==Battleground==
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*2 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**7 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is essentially [[Lady in the Clink]] reborn, except with the two other Pigges not included in that stage, Pigge and Zigge, making their appearance here. Not Suidae Piggicus though for some reason.

While this stage might seem annoying given Winged Pigge being Winged Pigge and Elizabeth being extremely tanky while also having Waves to chip down your stacks, [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Soractes]] and [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]] take care of it easily. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] with Research combos can serve as your main tanker for the hog horde, while [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Nova]] can Curse and Slow the other hogs. Make sure to bring [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to block against Elizabeth's Waves, and this stage will be cleared without much struggle.

